      "id": "qlneqnh",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1.1 Ancient History of Madhya Pradesh"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Ancient MP encompasses Prehistoric, Vedic, Mahajanapada, Mauryan, Post-Mauryan (Sungas, Kushanas, Satavahanas), Gupta, and Paramara periods.",
        "Medieval MP history covers the Delhi Sultanate, Malwa Sultanate, Sur Dynasty, Akbar's Conquest, and the Bundela Rajputs.",
        "Modern developments feature Maratha Rule, British administration via Central Provinces and Central India Agency, the Freedom Struggle, and the official Formation of Madhya Pradesh."
      ],
      "id": "oz3qsef"
    },
